{
  "id": "武王",
  "name": "武王",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "person",
  "typeConfidence": "medium",
  "description": null,
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 8,
      "entryId": "soushenji-08-04",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "武王伐纣，至河上，雨甚。疾雷，晦冥"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-07-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "障险阴，其无所逃之亦明矣。\n\n武王伐纣，渡于孟津，阳侯之波，逆流"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 9,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-09-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "三百乘，伐桀于南巢，放之夏台；武王甲卒三千，破纣牧野，杀之于宣室"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-10-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "之道明矣。文王智而好间，故圣；武王勇而好问，故胜，夫乘众人之智，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-11-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，舜立诽谤之木，汤有司直之人，武王立戒慎之鞀，过若毫厘，而既已备"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 12,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-12-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，人也。太公望、周公旦，天非为武王造之也；崇侯、恶来，天非为纣生"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-13-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "禹令民聚上积薪，择丘陵而外之。武王伐纣，载尸而行，海内未定，故不"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 14,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-14-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n\n昔尧之佐九人，舜之佐七人，武王之佐五人。尧、舜、武王于九、七"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-15-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "也。立子以长，文王舍伯邑考而用武王，非制也。礼三十而娶，文王十三"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-18-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "天下应之者，积怨在于民也。\n\n武王伐纣，东面而迎岁，至记而水，至"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 21,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-21-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "；文王葬死人之骸，而九夷归之；武王荫喝人于樾下，左拥而右扇之，而"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 23,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-23-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "忠臣也，而未可谓弟也。汤放桀，武王伐纣，以为天下去残除贼，可谓惠"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 24,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-24-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "之谋生焉。\n\n文王业之而不卒，武王继文王之业，用大公之谋，悉索薄"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "soushenji",
    "chapterIndex": 8
  }
}
